        ("Why can recursive calls to process.nextTick() starve the Node.js event loop?", "Because Node will not proceed to any event loop phase until the nextTick queue is empty. Recursive nextTick calls cause I/O starvation (server freezes).", "Advanced", "Scenario", "", "What is the difference between macrotasks and microtasks in Node.js?",),
