        ("What is the EventEmitter class in Node.js?", "EventEmitter is a core class in the 'events' module that enables objects to emit named events and register listener callbacks.", "Easy", "Concept", "const EventEmitter = require('events');\nconst emitter = new EventEmitter();", "What core modules extend EventEmitter?"),
